WEBVTT

00:00:05.436 --> 00:00:08.337
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.039 --> 00:00:11.909
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.909 --> 00:00:13.968
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.812 --> 00:00:18.942
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.518 --> 00:00:23.354
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.354 --> 00:00:25.481
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.257 --> 00:00:30.284
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:31.996 --> 00:00:34.765
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.765 --> 00:00:37.393
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.668 --> 00:00:41.263
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.706 --> 00:00:47.370
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.379 --> 00:00:49.880
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:53.077
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.919 --> 00:00:57.087
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.087 --> 00:01:01.148
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.392 --> 00:01:06.022
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:09.288
Let's go!

00:01:12.736 --> 00:01:16.001
SNAP! SNAP! CRACKLE! SNAP!

00:02:38.589 --> 00:02:40.523
Special planetside liberty.

00:02:40.591 --> 00:02:43.185
The brass can really
treat you well, sometimes.

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:48.427
Guys! Look at that!

00:02:49.867 --> 00:02:52.597
That's that new cruiser, the Aso.

00:02:55.005 --> 00:02:57.235
I'd heard rumors it
was being developed...

00:02:57.374 --> 00:02:59.069
...but it looks like
it's nearly complete.

00:03:04.848 --> 00:03:08.011
Just once, I'd love to serve
on a new ship like that!

00:03:08.485 --> 00:03:12.080
They say newer is better
for ships and tatami mats.

00:03:12.489 --> 00:03:13.513
Okay, then, it's settled!

00:03:14.692 --> 00:03:16.853
What's settled, sir?

00:03:17.328 --> 00:03:20.320
I'll ask to get the Aso
for our next ship.

00:03:20.431 --> 00:03:22.331
Well, I suppose
you could, but...

00:03:23.467 --> 00:03:25.458
To be blunt,
it's impossible, sir.

00:03:27.304 --> 00:03:28.430
Maybe you're right...

00:03:45.422 --> 00:03:48.983
People of the Soyokaze!
Well done on your last battle.

00:03:49.159 --> 00:03:52.925
Your combat performance is
highly rated in our forces.

00:03:53.397 --> 00:03:55.922
What our new heroes
need now is rest.

00:03:56.433 --> 00:03:59.334
I want you to take advantage
of this base's facilities...

00:03:59.403 --> 00:04:01.633
...to relax and prepare
for your next battle.

00:04:04.575 --> 00:04:05.906
Captain Tylor!

00:04:06.076 --> 00:04:06.667
Sir?

00:04:07.044 --> 00:04:10.445
I have great confidence
in your command abilities...

00:04:12.082 --> 00:04:16.109
...so I'm considering you for
command of the cruiser Aso.

00:04:18.122 --> 00:04:21.421
Um...
Uh, give me the Aso, sir?

00:04:22.593 --> 00:04:25.653
You will be formally
assigned to it in a few days!

00:04:27.898 --> 00:04:31.698
Until then, rest up and
recover from your battles!

00:04:33.837 --> 00:04:34.895
Aye, aye, sir!

00:04:47.451 --> 00:04:50.909
How typical of the captain.
His mind is already...

00:04:50.988 --> 00:04:53.957
...working on his upcoming
command of the Aso.

00:04:54.625 --> 00:04:57.458
This is not the place
for ordinary soldiers!

00:04:58.996 --> 00:04:59.860
Oh, yeah!

00:05:00.464 --> 00:05:00.896
Sir!

00:05:04.935 --> 00:05:08.735
His rest home's on this planet,
right? Admiral Hanner's, I mean.

00:05:08.906 --> 00:05:10.100
Yeah, that's right.

00:05:10.441 --> 00:05:12.033
Let's go visit him.

00:05:12.109 --> 00:05:13.371
Sir, you can't!

00:05:13.911 --> 00:05:17.745
They just told you that the high
command is giving a party tonight!

00:05:18.182 --> 00:05:20.514
Oh, yeah. A party, huh?

00:05:20.718 --> 00:05:22.811
Yes, a party.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:25.584
You like parties, don't you?

00:05:25.689 --> 00:05:27.350
Well, yeah...

00:05:31.028 --> 00:05:33.428
The sunset was pretty the
last time we were here, too.

00:05:33.831 --> 00:05:36.129
Yes. I also remember.

00:06:28.752 --> 00:06:32.017
What?! The admiral's...

00:06:32.322 --> 00:06:33.223
He can't be!

00:06:33.223 --> 00:06:34.212
It's not true!

00:06:36.393 --> 00:06:40.727
I'm sorry. There's no way I
can lie to make this any easier.

00:06:44.535 --> 00:06:45.934
Mr. Tylor!

00:06:53.277 --> 00:06:56.838
Admiral Hanner is... Is dead...

00:07:16.767 --> 00:07:16.967
HOORAY FOR CAPTAIN TYLOR!

00:07:16.967 --> 00:07:20.504
HOORAY FOR CAPTAIN TYLOR!
Shortly after enlisting in the
United Planets Space Force...

00:07:20.504 --> 00:07:22.906
HOORAY FOR CAPTAIN TYLOR!
...Commander Tylor rescued the
famous retired admiral Hanner...

00:07:22.906 --> 00:07:24.908
HOORAY FOR CAPTAIN TYLOR!
...who'd been taken
hostage by terrorists.

00:07:24.908 --> 00:07:25.340
...who'd been taken
hostage by terrorists.

00:07:25.409 --> 00:07:28.412
Promoted from the pension department
to the rank of lieutenant commander...

00:07:28.412 --> 00:07:33.050
...he took command of the destroyer
Soyokaze and proceeded to...

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:37.146
...single-handedly destroy a Raalgon
cruiser and three destroyers!

00:07:37.321 --> 00:07:41.280
After that, he earned special
merit for single-handedly...

00:07:41.358 --> 00:07:46.318
...destroying the Donan fleet,
led by the renowned Admiral Donan!

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:50.259
And, in our decisive battle with
the Raalgon fleet the other day...

00:07:50.467 --> 00:07:54.198
...his heroic strategy after
taking command led to a brill...

00:07:56.073 --> 00:07:57.700
To a brilliant victory!

00:08:00.177 --> 00:08:02.941
Therefore, I offer a toast
to Commander Tylor...

00:08:03.013 --> 00:08:05.948
...for all his great work and
the great deeds still to come.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.148
Cheers!

00:08:07.384 --> 00:08:09.147
Cheers!

00:08:42.019 --> 00:08:44.954
Commander Tylor!
Use a fork or chopsticks!

00:08:45.422 --> 00:08:47.185
How dare you eat
with your fingers!

00:09:00.337 --> 00:09:02.862
Where are you going?!
You think you can run away?!

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:06.234
Commander Tylor!
This party is in your honor!

00:09:06.443 --> 00:09:08.138
You think you can
make fools of us?!

00:09:08.512 --> 00:09:10.002
Admiral, wait!

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:11.012
But!

00:09:16.219 --> 00:09:16.913
Lieutenant!

00:09:17.087 --> 00:09:17.644
Right!

00:09:24.061 --> 00:09:25.585
Commander Star, up there!

00:09:37.207 --> 00:09:39.368
Captain! Please, stop that!

00:09:39.943 --> 00:09:41.342
Oh, Mr. Yamamoto!

00:09:41.912 --> 00:09:46.076
Don't "Oh, Mr. Yamamoto" me!
What are you doing up there?!

00:09:46.383 --> 00:09:49.716
What are you doing
down there, Mr. Yamamoto?

00:09:52.656 --> 00:09:53.782
Captain!

00:09:54.324 --> 00:09:57.691
Captain, it's dangerous!
Please, come down now!

00:10:16.713 --> 00:10:19.147
Captain, please!
Snap out of it!

00:10:20.117 --> 00:10:22.950
No, you guys
should snap out of it.

00:10:24.654 --> 00:10:28.283
If you don't, you'll let
life sneak up on you.

00:10:30.027 --> 00:10:31.858
Let life sneak up on you?

00:11:09.866 --> 00:11:14.860
I see... The man who sent
that message to our forces...

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:20.943
Another man who may be called
a true leader has died.

00:11:21.378 --> 00:11:23.539
Admiral Robert J. Hanner...

00:11:24.448 --> 00:11:28.043
He was a soldier who could see
through to the true essence of war.

00:11:31.755 --> 00:11:33.746
Dom, don't you think...

00:11:33.824 --> 00:11:36.349
...we should pay our
respects to this man Hanner?

00:11:47.471 --> 00:11:49.905
Activate primary energy sphere!

00:12:10.393 --> 00:12:11.553
Looks like it worked.

00:12:11.995 --> 00:12:15.522
Highness...
You've become so daring!

00:12:15.765 --> 00:12:17.096
That's thanks to Paco-Paco.

00:12:18.368 --> 00:12:19.665
Paco-Paco, eh?

00:12:20.203 --> 00:12:23.934
I wonder what Paco-Paco will do
when he suddenly sees me again?

00:12:28.979 --> 00:12:30.344
Will you do Noriko a favor?

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:32.714
Put your talents to good use!

00:12:34.718 --> 00:12:39.314
The United Planets Space Force
is looking for energetic people!

00:12:40.824 --> 00:12:44.225
Defenders of universal peace
and the green hills of home.

00:12:44.294 --> 00:12:47.127
I think people like
that are wonderful...

00:12:47.697 --> 00:12:48.857
Young People!
The UPSF is
Waiting for You!

00:12:49.666 --> 00:12:51.566
We're waiting for you!

00:12:52.435 --> 00:12:54.232
We're waiting for you!

00:12:55.105 --> 00:12:56.970
We're waiting for you!

00:13:21.898 --> 00:13:23.729
This is death...

00:13:24.901 --> 00:13:27.062
This is what humans fear most.

00:13:41.084 --> 00:13:42.381
Yes. Harumi here.

00:13:53.863 --> 00:13:54.557
How are they?

00:13:54.965 --> 00:13:57.024
They cried themselves to sleep.

00:13:57.367 --> 00:13:58.334
I see.

00:14:05.642 --> 00:14:07.974
Lieutenant, is the captain still?

00:14:09.946 --> 00:14:10.537
Oh.

00:14:11.881 --> 00:14:13.712
I don't understand.

00:14:14.284 --> 00:14:16.809
What did the captain mean before?

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:21.279
Of course, he adored
Admiral Hanner, but...

00:14:22.259 --> 00:14:24.750
I'm not sure how to put this.

00:14:29.132 --> 00:14:31.498
The captain's discovered
something else.

00:14:32.269 --> 00:14:34.104
I can't help thinking that...

00:14:34.104 --> 00:14:37.130
...he's discovered something
else beyond the admiral's death.

00:14:38.608 --> 00:14:40.371
Something else?

00:14:49.386 --> 00:14:52.219
The Church of the Galactic Fool
Will Save the Galaxy!

00:15:53.650 --> 00:15:56.642
The captain never
showed up, did he?

00:15:57.287 --> 00:15:57.981
No.

00:16:02.092 --> 00:16:03.491
Lieutenant? Commander?

00:16:04.861 --> 00:16:08.388
There are some people here
who'd like to pay their respects.

00:16:09.265 --> 00:16:10.323
Could they?

00:16:10.667 --> 00:16:14.604
Yes, of course. I'm sure the
late admiral would be happy...

00:16:14.604 --> 00:16:16.868
...to have another
visitor or two.

00:16:28.218 --> 00:16:29.947
Y- Your Highness!

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:31.452
It's been a while.

00:16:32.255 --> 00:16:33.586
Aren't you?!

00:16:34.357 --> 00:16:35.654
Ru Baraba Dom.

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:43.060
They contacted me and said they
wanted to attend the funeral.

00:16:43.266 --> 00:16:44.995
I made the arrangements.

00:16:45.668 --> 00:16:48.796
Although an enemy commander,
the admiral was a true soldier.

00:16:49.172 --> 00:16:51.697
We wish to offer our
flowers to him as well.

00:16:52.075 --> 00:16:55.203
Please. I'm sure the admiral
would have been honored.

00:16:55.712 --> 00:16:56.701
Our thanks to you.

00:17:01.084 --> 00:17:02.881
I don't see Paco-Paco here.

00:17:05.021 --> 00:17:07.216
Where is Paco-Paco?

00:17:14.864 --> 00:17:17.526
The captain never came.

00:17:17.801 --> 00:17:18.495
No.

00:17:28.645 --> 00:17:29.304
Captain!

00:17:30.313 --> 00:17:31.075
Paco-Paco!

00:17:31.247 --> 00:17:32.009
No, wait.

00:17:41.324 --> 00:17:47.456
Step by step, bit by bit,
he rose in the world.

00:17:48.465 --> 00:17:54.335
From lieutenant to commander
and finally to admiral.

00:17:55.305 --> 00:18:01.039
And, in the end,
the admiral was a great man.

00:18:02.245 --> 00:18:07.877
Ah... What a great
life you lived, sir...

00:18:08.952 --> 00:18:11.386
And then, when you were happiest...

00:18:12.322 --> 00:18:14.552
...suddenly, from the next world...

00:18:15.925 --> 00:18:20.589
...came the call
for you to come home.

00:18:21.364 --> 00:18:24.265
Farewell, my friend.

00:18:25.401 --> 00:18:31.772
Ah, life should be lived
as long as it can be.

00:18:32.842 --> 00:18:38.439
So, let's try our best
to enjoy it all we can.

00:18:39.816 --> 00:18:42.011
One, two, three, four, five.

00:18:43.253 --> 00:18:45.653
Take a deep breath, and one two.

00:18:46.823 --> 00:18:51.021
Now let's open our mouths up wide...

00:18:52.228 --> 00:18:54.890
...and let out a laugh.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:31.998
Admiral, sir...

00:19:33.336 --> 00:19:35.930
Thank you for everything!

00:19:42.045 --> 00:19:43.069
Mr. Tylor...

00:19:44.447 --> 00:19:46.574
What's with the captain?

00:19:47.016 --> 00:19:48.210
I don't know, either.

00:19:51.354 --> 00:19:53.652
Dom, why is Paco-Paco
acting like this?

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:56.784
I don't know, Your Highness.
However...

00:19:58.394 --> 00:19:59.520
That smile...

00:20:04.167 --> 00:20:07.432
That relieved smile
on his face worries me.

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:43.534
Yuriko! Over here!

00:20:52.482 --> 00:20:54.848
Sorry I called you
out here like this.

00:20:55.885 --> 00:20:58.285
This is something I had
to tell you personally.

00:21:00.556 --> 00:21:01.318
Captain...

00:21:07.597 --> 00:21:08.564
You see...

00:21:30.953 --> 00:21:31.817
Captain...

00:21:40.196 --> 00:21:41.094
Captain...

00:21:51.674 --> 00:21:54.336
Why, Captain?

00:22:13.229 --> 00:22:14.218
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:16.032 --> 00:22:17.897
Enough of dress shirts and ships!

00:22:18.234 --> 00:22:20.636
Tylor followed
his heart on board...

00:22:20.636 --> 00:22:22.934
...and now he follows
it off his ship.

00:22:23.072 --> 00:22:25.370
Next time,
"My Way is the Hard Way."

00:22:25.608 --> 00:22:26.142
Watch for it.

00:22:26.142 --> 00:22:26.476
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound
Watch for it.

00:22:26.476 --> 00:22:28.000
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound

00:22:39.222 --> 00:22:42.325
All he has to do is just...
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:42.325 --> 00:22:45.419
...walk around downtown.
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:45.928 --> 00:22:49.398
He's a playful man who catches...
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:49.398 --> 00:22:52.231
...the eyes of all who he meets.
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:52.735 --> 00:22:55.571
Oh! That's why, you see...
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:22:55.571 --> 00:22:59.371
...he'll be our hero from now on.
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:23:00.176 --> 00:23:02.545
So, let's begin...
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:02.545 --> 00:23:06.379
...the countdown for the change!
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:09.852 --> 00:23:12.650
Take a deep breath, and one two.
12345 Ikizugi o One Two

00:23:13.790 --> 00:23:16.125
Now stride out...
Saa Kore kara Kuridasou

00:23:16.125 --> 00:23:19.288
...with your head held high.
Saa Kore kara Kuridasou

00:23:19.428 --> 00:23:23.159
Downtown Dance
